{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SPruCo6GyGrff5uTi1r8Lm","type":"tool_result","content":"makes admissible, `P(pathwidth ≤ k) ≤ E[Σ_{(A, R)} 1[(A, R) empty] / #flips G A R]` over the\nexact-size pairs. The evaluation of the right-hand side on random covers by the joint\nbinomial moments (Lemma J) is on paper. -/\ntheorem weightedSum_graphsOfPathwidthLe_le_flipWeighted (p : ℝ) (hp0 : 0 ≤ p) (hp1 : p ≤ 1)\n    (k : ℕ) (hk : k < Fintype.card V) :\n    ∑ G ∈ graphsOfPathwidthLe (V := V) k, gnpWeight p G ≤\n      ∑ G : SimpleGraph V, gnpWeight p G *\n        ∑ q ∈ pairIndices (V := V) ((Fintype.card V - k + 1) / 2) ((Fintype.card V - k) / 2),\n          if IsEmptyPair G q.1 q.2 then (1 : ℝ) / (flips G q.1 q.2).card else 0 := by\n  refine weightedSum_graphsOfPathwidthLe_le_weighted p hp0 hp1 k hk\n    (fun G q => (flips G q.1 q.2).card) (fun G q hq hE => ⟨one_le_card_flips G q.1 q.2, ?_⟩)\n  have := card_flips_le G (t := (Fintype.card V - k + 1) / 2) (r := (Fintype.card V - k) / 2)\n    (A := q.1) (R := q.2) hq hE\n  convert this using 3\n\nend MOSPFormalization\n999:open scoped Classical in\n1129:open scoped Classical in\n1229:open scoped Classical in\n.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Data/Finset/Lattice/Basic.lean:308:@[simp] lemma inter_eq_right : t ∩ s = s ↔ s ⊆ t := inf_eq_right","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b730e376-1e87-4aa7-bc1e-a9af33642283","uuid":"7c38b7cc-745c-422e-8050-99662ae37c57","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:38:13.232Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"makes admissible, `P(pathwidth ≤ k) ≤ E[Σ_{(A, R)} 1[(A, R) empty] / #flips G A R]` over the\nexact-size pairs. The evaluation of the right-hand side on random covers by the joint\nbinomial moments (Lemma J) is on paper. -/\ntheorem weightedSum_graphsOfPathwidthLe_le_flipWeighted (p : ℝ) (hp0 : 0 ≤ p) (hp1 : p ≤ 1)\n    (k : ℕ) (hk : k < Fintype.card V) :\n    ∑ G ∈ graphsOfPathwidthLe (V := V) k, gnpWeight p G ≤\n      ∑ G : SimpleGraph V, gnpWeight p G *\n        ∑ q ∈ pairIndices (V := V) ((Fintype.card V - k + 1) / 2) ((Fintype.card V - k) / 2),\n          if IsEmptyPair G q.1 q.2 then (1 : ℝ) / (flips G q.1 q.2).card else 0 := by\n  refine weightedSum_graphsOfPathwidthLe_le_weighted p hp0 hp1 k hk\n    (fun G q => (flips G q.1 q.2).card) (fun G q hq hE => ⟨one_le_card_flips G q.1 q.2, ?_⟩)\n  have := card_flips_le G (t := (Fintype.card V - k + 1) / 2) (r := (Fintype.card V - k) / 2)\n    (A := q.1) (R := q.2) hq hE\n  convert this using 3\n\nend MOSPFormalization\n999:open scoped Classical in\n1129:open scoped Classical in\n1229:open scoped Classical in\n.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Data/Finset/Lattice/Basic.lean:308:@[simp] lemma inter_eq_right : t ∩ s = s ↔ s ⊆ t := inf_eq_right","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SPruCo6GyGrff5uTi1r8Lm","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
